      "title": "BGP: Fix false positive in add-path detection",
      "message": "BGP: Fix false positive in add-path detection\n\nThe detect_add_path_prefix46() function incorrectly used\n'end - offset' instead of 'end - o' when checking for\nremaining bytes after a /0 prefix. This caused NLRIs\ncontaining default route (0.0.0.0/0) to be misidentified\nas add-path format, resulting in malformed packet errors.\n",
